flowchart TD
    A[Failure Types] --> B[Transaction failure]
    A --> C[System crash]
    A --> D[Disk failure]

    B --> E[Logical error]
    B --> F[System error deadlock]

    C --> G[Power loss / OS crash]
    G --> H[Buffer contents lost]

    D --> I[Head crash / data corruption]
    I --> J[Requires backup restore]

    K[Storage Hierarchy] --> L[Volatile memory]
    K --> M[Stable storage]
    K --> N[Physical database disk]

    O[WAL Write-Ahead Logging] --> P[Log before data]
    O --> Q[Undo and Redo records]
    O --> R[Log sequence number LSN]

    S[Checkpointing] --> T[Force dirty pages to disk]
    S --> U[Truncate log]
    S --> V[Fuzzy checkpoint]

    W[ARIES Algorithm] --> X[Analysis phase]
    W --> Y[Redo phase]
    W --> Z[Undo phase]

    X --> AA[Identify dirty pages]
    X --> AB[Find winner / loser transactions]

    Y --> AC[Reapply all changes from log]
    Y --> AD[Idempotent replay]

    Z --> AE[Undo loser transactions]
    Z --> AF[Generate compensation log records]

    AG[Remote Backup] --> AH[Log shipping]
    AG --> AI[Replication]
    AG --> AJ[Two-Phase Commit 2PC]
